<l n="b"><milestone unit="column" n="b"/>daśagarbhām atiṣṭhipat</l>
<l n="c"><lb n="N32"/><milestone unit="column" n="a"/>Ācāryyabhuvi devena</l>
<l n="d"><milestone unit="column" n="b"/>sthāpitām uttarāpathe</l>
</lg>
                   <lg n="37" met="anuṣṭubh">
<l n="a"><lb n="N33"/><milestone unit="column" n="a"/>bhuvi devas sa ācāryyo</l>
