<l n="c" enjamb="yes"><lb n="N34"/><milestone unit="column" n="a"/>prāk sthāpayām āsa suhr̥d</l>
<l n="d">-dvayena sa tu tāṁ punaḥ<milestone unit="column" n="b"/></l>
